{"resourceIdentifier":"2291","resourceName":"Guizhou Panjiang Low Concentration Coal Mine Methane Power Generation Project Phase 2","description":"Guizhou Panjiang Low Concentration Coal Mine Methane Power Generation Project Phase 2 (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located in Pan County, Liu Panshui City, Guizhou Province, China. The aim of the Project is is to utilize the extracted CMM with methane concentration of 6-30% to produce electricity. No coal bed methane (CBM) or ventilation air methane (VAM) utilization is involved. Thirty CMM power generation units will be installed with a total installed capacity of 17.7MW, destroying 25.22 million m3 of methane annually. \r\n\r\nAfter the full operation of the Project, the annual exported electricity will be 78,163 MWh, which will be supplied to the coalmines through the electricity distribution network in Panjiang coal mine area, replacing the electricity that would otherwise have been purchased from the CSPG. The waste heat from the generators will be recovered by waste heat boilers to provide free hot water to the coal mines, which was provided by waste coal fired boilers before the implementation of the Project.\r\n\r\nThe expected total emission reduction of the Project in the crediting periods of 10 years is 4,199,250 tCO2e, and the annual emission reduction is estimated to be 419,925 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":25.700300,"longitude":104.542800},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-05-28","endExclusive":"2020-06-28","endInclusive":"2020-06-27"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2291"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou Panjiang CBM Development&Utilization Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2291"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"419925"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fugitive emissions from fuels (solid, oil and gas)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0008"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV NORD CERT GmbH"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30/11/2020"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 26/02/2018 - 25/02/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=46628&IDKEY=898klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d964300012","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Panjiang II_VCS PD_draft.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-05-02T12:56:17.493Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=46630&IDKEY=d097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87d64302770","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Panjiang II_VCS Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-05-02T12:58:00.33Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=48399&IDKEY=iiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfl66742221","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"01-Panjiang II_VCS PD_V3.0_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-08-31T09:44:59.167Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=48400&IDKEY=l98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8ds66743600","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"06-Panjiang II_VCS-Registration-Representation-Single-Repr